{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_UxJbs1xMhTxPZrv_hYYWQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:20.650298+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_UxJbs1xMhTxPZrv_hYYWQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/CiblDpJMP7PL491jVz6INuMRCY1gqCk195lOK2sfLaTo1aGoZcHaIrKiazXZ2vJQ2JKqaGDic54RmGZ3n6ziaa6U9VlhwJkZOXgOdNQzzG2iasXg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>为加强高校间优秀大学生的沟通和交流，为广大学子提供了解南方科技大学海洋科学与工程系的机会，培育学生科研兴趣及创新精神，激发学生创新潜力，海洋科学与工程系欢迎全国优秀大学生报名夏季交流营活动。</span><span><span>欢迎全国的优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、研究领域</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Wl9FpZe5C07JAJQKquicElTTPce9gltL9Hm3nJ3icTN0ZRrm5fecr9lWEp9UyoExDrGE9BWV9wlibck01z0uIPSttx0RNIXsfc6GxCLfibia4ia0E/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>海洋科学方向</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>海洋地质，海洋地球物理，物理海洋，海洋磁学、海洋气象学，海洋化学，海洋微生物学，海洋环境与灾害，气候变化对海洋动力过程的影响等。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Wl9FpZe5C07JAJQKquicElTTPce9gltL9Hm3nJ3icTN0ZRrm5fecr9lWEp9UyoExDrGE9BWV9wlibck01z0uIPSttx0RNIXsfc6GxCLfibia4ia0E/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>海洋工程与技术方向</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>海洋工程材料与结构，海岸与近海工程，海洋岩土工程、海洋动力学、</span><span>海洋可再生能源与海洋航行器推进</span><span>等。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>对海洋科学、海洋工程、以及相关的前沿交叉领域的研究抱有浓厚兴趣的同学，且满足以下条件：</span></p><ol><li><p><span>全国高校本科三年级在校生（2027届本科毕业生），可获得免推资格的本科生优先考虑；</span></p></li><li><p><span>成绩优秀，英语水平良好</span></p></li><li><p><span>科研兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力</span></p></li><li><p><span>身心健康、诚实守信、学风端正</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动时间：</span></strong><span>预计2026年6月底到7月初；</span></p><p><strong><span>活动安排：</span></strong><span>拟邀请通过资格审查的优秀学生参加线下活动，内容包括：开营仪式、院系介绍、学长学姐分享、课题组师生交流、实验室参观等。</span></p><p><strong><span>活动费用：</span></strong><span>系里将为异地学生交流期间安排住宿，其它费用需自理。</span></p><p><em><span><span>* 活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；入营学生须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></span></em></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span><strong><span>报名时间：即日起－ 6月14日23:59</span></strong></span></p></li><li><p><span>报名方式：申请人登录南科大全国优秀大学生交流营网上报名系统注册登录，并按要求提供本人各项真实信息。网址：https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/（建议使用Chrome或360极速浏览器）需填报不超过3个意向交流导师并上传以下证明材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；成绩单上标注所在专业的成绩排名；</span></p><p><span>（4）个人陈述（介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作，以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内）；</span></p><p><span>（5）英语水平证明材料（四、六级英语证书，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></p><p><span>（6）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、代表性的学术论文首页、专利授权证明等）。</span></p><p><span>（7）个人简历（一页，中文简历）</span></p></li><li><p><span>招生导师及研究方向见系官网（或点击文末“阅读原文”跳转至系官网）：</span></p><p><span>https://ocean.sustech.edu.cn/views/staff.html</span></p></li></ol></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、材料审核及入选通知</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请截止后，审核工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将以电子邮件形式通知。未通过审核者不作另外通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>有关夏令营的活动咨询，请以“夏令营咨询”为邮件主题发送给oceanyzb@sustech.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>或致电：0755-88018758（郭老师）</span></p><p><span>更多信息请关注南科大海洋系官微或官网：</span></p><p><span>https://ocean.sustech.edu.cn/</span></p></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、往期夏令营回顾</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/CiblDpJMP7PJI2LRticueKIjdpoEcDfeWzPhFK0agSPUqMtzMSfhVUettIPt53lSbibatN6079ALHic40jWHH6a9LZVqmc5v8OTdTRP87tUeKaE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></secti